  "title": "Spaghetti Sauce II",
  "description": "A very thick and dark sauce with a little red pepper kick. Serve with browned Italian sausages, or omit them for a vegetarian meal. This sauce freezes well too.",
  "authors": [
    "Melinda Connery"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-02-05T17:44:25-05:00",
